 "text": "Hi, how are you keeping? Lots of people struggle with that. A few simple hacks apply. Which room are you working in? Then an earbud cable gets used. Stick long cable you can pull into the living and keep only short as you earbud goes in each ear. You can use noise blocking earplugs while you work. They' small and don't need to go in and out with you. Or try earbuds with earbud volume well below loud so it gives earbuds a buffer. It' worth trying. A quiet room with full length cable earbuds and quiet earbuds will beat distractions big time.",
